> > >
> > > Refactor writings for ID_AA64PFR0_EL1.[CSV2|CSV3],
> > > ID_AA64DFR0_EL1.PMUVer and ID_DFR0_ELF.PerfMon based on utilities
> > > specific to ID register.
> > >
